From 088a9b9c69d24e4e7cbe77bd0931248d617b9271 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 10:09:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] ARM: anyka: add AK3918EV300 machine, interrupt
 controller, timer and UART

Platform support: ARCH_ANYKA, mach-anyka, the interrupt controller, the system timer and the UART. The core PLL must be 640 MHz (SYSCTRL 0x08 = 0x010203a0) for the clocks to match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014gtE1qwzw7JFQVcpbdix3V
